    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend Toby is upset that you\u2019re moving and now won\u2019t let you leave. Can you find a way to escape before he becomes too powerful to avoid? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get yourself ready before the lights go out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/0753cd6eafd56ebf19b0485d2fb12e43.poster.avif?t=1737797578\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/0753cd6eafd56ebf19b0485d2fb12e43.webm?t=1737797578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/0753cd6eafd56ebf19b0485d2fb12e43.mp4?t=1737797578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Quiet!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running on hard surfaces could grab unwanted attention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/a0b0fcfce7dabfd26ce017c39df05718.poster.avif?t=1737797578\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/a0b0fcfce7dabfd26ce017c39df05718.webm?t=1737797578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/a0b0fcfce7dabfd26ce017c39df05718.mp4?t=1737797578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can\u2019t run forever!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Inhaler has limited puffs, so use it sparingly to keep your stamina accumulating quick enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/f8cafa2c6dc90b8b0d014ec8c8386573.avif?t=1737797578\" width=609 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delay the inevitable by upgrading yourself with the points you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/82b276e286cc111f0372ddc6fdca40d5.poster.avif?t=1737797578\" width=608 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/82b276e286cc111f0372ddc6fdca40d5.webm?t=1737797578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095680/extras/82b276e286cc111f0372ddc6fdca40d5.mp4?t=1737797578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How long will you survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main map with objectives, boss fight, and an ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus survival map\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional challenges for each map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
